SJ0008 Political expenditures.
Sponsored By: Senator(s) Cooper, Anderson, Barlow, Boner, Brennan,
Crago, Crum, Dockstader, Driskill, Gierau, Hutchings,
Jones, Landen, Nethercott, Pappas, Schuler and Scott
and Representative(s) Brown, L, Byron, Connolly,
Davis, Erickson, Geringer, Jarvis, Larsen, L, McCann,
Schmid, Styvar, Washut, Wasserburger, Wharff,
Williams and Wylie
A JOINT RESOLUTION requesting Congress to propose a constitutional amendment to
authorize states and Congress to establish reasonable limits on political
contributions made to influence elections.
